ef1c3365eb29"],

Cell["\<\
three aspects of the totally antisymmetric tensor \[Epsilon] :
1. its relation to the determinant of a matrix\[LineSeparator]2. its role as \
invariant tensor of so(n), in the example of so(3)\[LineSeparator]3. using it \
as example of how symmetries can provide efficient computer storage\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9766937979464808`*^9, 3.976693871479348*^9}, {
  3.9766981252592707`*^9, 
  3.9766981734490023`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"4021230d-7ab9-43e4-8738-\
a51b626b68ea"],

